# Start: the CLOUD hub, focus on BACK UP TO THE CLOUD. End: SYSTEMS TO BACK
# UP, focus on SELECT ALL. The transfer page opens on SAVES; two down is the
# SYSTEMS TO BACK UP row under ROMS AND BIOS. The scan takes a few seconds.
key x
wait 2
shot back-up-page
key down
wait 1
key down
wait 1
key x
wait 7
shot systems-to-back-up
